WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Me voy.

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.560
Are you coming with me?

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.280
Um...

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.560
I think I’ll stay.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:12.480
I have a couple more important

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.000
meetings to do. So...

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.360
Why don't you take Anthony with you?

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:18.880
Of course.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.840
It is more important to you than...

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.960
Than your family.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:26.080
Cold-hearted bastard.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.400
What else could I expect

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.720
from the Powells?

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.560
Veronica!

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.640
What's going on? Are you all right?

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:35.640
Let's go, Anthony.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:44.640
Thanks.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:49.720
Go ahead without me.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:50.640
Check with him

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:52.280
and find out what happened. Go.
